                "scripts/foo.nu",
                r#"
                    $env.FOO = "foo"
                "#,
            )])
            .with_files(&[FileWithContentToBeTrimmed(
                "main.nu",
                "
                    source-env foo.nu
                ",
            )]);

        let inp_lines = &[
